   "title": "Notes",
   "properties": {},
   "widgets_values": [
    "## Nomas World\n\nEach **Nomas World Continue** adds a turn: a camera move, a change in words, or both. Chain as many as you like; the latent always holds the whole world.\n\n- Camera scripts: one `<keys> <seconds>` per line (w a s d up down left right, `wait`), keys joined with `+`. A camera path sets the turn length.\n- Write `<|Subject1|>` for the subject in scene / action text.\n- Trained at **1280x704**. 8 steps; the distilled DiT also works at 4 or 6.\n- For a multi-segment prompt with timestamps, swap Nomas World Prompt for **Nomas Prompt (JSON)**."
   ],
   "widgets_values_named": {
    "text": "## Nomas World\n\nEach **Nomas World Continue** adds a turn: a camera move, a change in words, or both. Chain as many as you like; the latent always holds the whole world.\n\n- Camera scripts: one `<keys> <seconds>` per line (w a s d up down left right, `wait`), keys joined with `+`. A camera path sets the turn length.\n- Write `<|Subject1|>` for the subject in scene / action text.\n- Trained at **1280x704**. 8 steps; the distilled DiT also works at 4 or 6.\n- For a multi-segment prompt with timestamps, swap Nomas World Prompt for **Nomas Prompt (JSON)**."
   },
   "color": "#432",
   "bgcolor": "#653"
  }
